# Repository Licensing and Legal Notices

This repository operates as an open-source distribution wrapper, configuration preset, and packaging automation pipeline for the native PC port of *Tekken Tag Tournament 2*.

Because this project combines repository-specific automation, upstream compiled recompilation components, and third-party redistributables, distinct licensing terms apply to different components as set forth below.

---

## 1. Distribution Wrapper Scripts, Configuration, and Documentation

The packaging scripts (`scripts/`), configuration templates (`config/` / `settings.ini`), diagnostic scripts (`tools/Reset_Save_Data.bat`), and documentation (`docs/`, `README.md`, `INSTALL_GUIDE.md`) authored specifically for this repository are licensed under the following terms:

