## 2. Upstream Recompilation Engine and Framework

The underlying game engine runtime (`Tekken Tag Tournament 2.exe` and `ttt2_setup.exe`) is developed and maintained upstream by **Shihab Al-Amri** and powered by the **XenonRecomp** framework created by **hedge-dev**. Upstream code is licensed under the standard MIT License:

- **Tekken Tag Tournament 2 PC Port Runtime:**
  Copyright (c) 2024-2026 Shihab Al-Amri (`shihabal3amri`)
  Repository: https://github.com/shihabal3amri/tekken-tag-tournament-2-pc
  License: MIT License

- **XenonRecomp Framework:**
  Copyright (c) 2023-2026 hedge-dev
  Repository: https://github.com/hedge-dev/XenonRecomp
  License: MIT License

Nothing in this repository's non-commercial wrapper policy modifies, restricts, or supersedes the rights granted by upstream copyright holders under their respective MIT licenses.

