**ZERO PROPRIETARY GAME DATA IS DISTRIBUTED:**
This repository and its distribution packages do not contain or distribute copyrighted ROMs, disc images (ISO), encrypted containers (`tekken.img`, `Default.xex`, `data*.bin`), or proprietary game assets. All game assets must be extracted by the end user from their own legally dumped, retail Xbox 360 media.
